<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-094-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.430427" lon="-120.989092"><name>SC26-094-A</name><cmt>SC26-094</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 10.6 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 76/100; not catch probability. Center 138 ft; nearby 130–162 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-072</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.43333658372597" lon="-120.98786305352141"/><trkpt lat="35.433073588093535" lon="-120.98831019154599"/><trkpt lat="35.432714974173955" lon="-120.98842926200211"/><trkpt lat="35.43271864379218" lon="-120.98864946618409"/><trkpt lat="35.432001414937375" lon="-120.98888760178802"/><trkpt lat="35.43200875197339" lon="-120.98932800643067"/><trkpt lat="35.431653804456" lon="-120.98966727203927"/><trkpt lat="35.4316611385863" lon="-120.99010767500029"/><trkpt lat="35.43121057688039" lon="-120.9901188748542"/><trkpt lat="35.43112413092531" lon="-120.9903413148653"/><trkpt lat="35.42986255776268" lon="-120.99037266956485"/><trkpt lat="35.42986805634138" lon="-120.99070296459972"/><trkpt lat="35.4295076067406" lon="-120.99071192125756"/><trkpt lat="35.4294966088261" lon="-120.99005133421707"/><trkpt lat="35.4289541012